=== COMPILER2 DIAGNOSTICS ===
  [hir] E0176

  × `baml` cannot be used as a binding name: the compiler spells `baml` when it lowers syntax such as `spawn` and `$env`, and this binding would shadow it. A class or function may still be named
  │ `baml`.
   ╭─[reserved_binding_name.baml:8:5]
 8 │     let baml = 5;
   ·     ────┬───
   ·         ╰── reserved binding name
   ╰────

